	quest.116EF0EFEB6E55C0.quest_desc: [
		"Let's get back on &#F1C40FTrack&f. This whole thing about bringing things back to life and rich people has left me a little confused. It feels like I was in a car crash..."
		""
		"Anyway, let's get back on track, kid."
		""
