		""
		"Lost somewhere, with no idea how to get &#3498DBBack&f..."
		""
		"And so... the sin of &#F1C40FGreed&f has arrived. We need to be &#E74C3CCareful&f with everything. We're very close to defeating the 7 &#8B0000Sinners&f."
		""
		"&#F1C40FGreed&f is sometimes a reflection of &#FF1493Lust&f, but it is our desire to always have more, always want more, and never be &#2ECC71Happy&f with what we have!"
