		"Okay, now that we know what this does, we need to grab that Flint and Steel and a Demon Fruit."
		""
		"Throw a Demon Fruit on the ground and set it on &#E74C3CFire&f with a Flint and Steel."
		""
		"This &#FF5733Flame&f can be used to throw items into it and burn them. By burning them, we can obtain &#9B59B6New&f items!"
